  "description": "After being reborn as the childhood friend of the female lead in a novel, Lariette quickly learns that the \"angelic\" heroine is really a two-faced bully! It's not enough to escape her clutches—Lariette needs to bring her down. And who better to help her than the villainess, who was framed by the female lead? With their combined wits and power, this unlikely duo is going to take their lives back! When a background character and a villainess team up, can the perfect heroine survive the fallout?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
